@prefix : <http://example.org/x#> .
@prefix dec: <http://w3id.org/conjectures/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
# Does a verbatim world that conflicts with reality get flagged (inconsistency check reasons on the union)?
:S { :Man owl:disjointWith :Woman . } :S a dec:sharedWorld .
:p a :Man .
:V { :p a :Woman . }
:ann :said :V . :said a dec:verbatimPredicate .
:B { :p a :Woman . }
:ann :believes :B . :believes a dec:doxasticPredicate .
[] dec:checkInconsistencies true .
